  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;and another of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> are moving with equal kinetic energy. The ratio of their respective momenta will be&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: The mass of the objects&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>.</p><p>Let the momentum of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;masses is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, respectively, then according to question, their kinetic energy are equal, i.e.,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
